{"3122220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mr Figs", "steam_appid": 3122220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/865346a94b662861862fa13f589a1d5b.poster.avif?t=1766428437\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/865346a94b662861862fa13f589a1d5b.webm?t=1766428437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/865346a94b662861862fa13f589a1d5b.mp4?t=1766428437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr Figs is a challenging top-down action puzzler where you play as Mr Figs - an adorable squid-like humanoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with as many bombs as you can carry, blast, manoeuvre and puzzle your way out of countless levels and areas, trying to reach the depths below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ levels across 4 different areas to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and &quot;aha!&quot; moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret challenge rooms (shh don't tell anyone)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle yourself out of tricky situations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/930b40caa725d1b27bb0b97d16862a62.poster.avif?t=1766428437\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/930